  "limitations": [
    "Exploratory Node synthetic measurement, not frozen campaign evaluator. No production optimizations, no candidate wins, no real-vault deploy or Obsidian DOM/layout/paint/native EA staging.",
    "All rectangles, contiguous groups, uniform z-order, empty metadata, no frames/bound text/images/freedraw/deletion. nested8 is breadth-containing depth8, not extreme nesting. Fixed shape/operation order; GC state and checks influence following iterations.",
    "Two warmups/five samples per operation/process: per-process p95 equals max; pooled 30-sample p95 descriptive only, not responsiveness/tail confidence. Async bench await adds microtask overhead to sync functions.",
    "Memory samples are cumulative process RSS/heap after operations and correctness checks; not isolated allocations, peak, leaks or heap-safety proof. Processes capped at 768MiB old-space; no multi-GiB run.",
    "Tree leaf uniqueness/coverage checked; group oracle uses subject indexes and expected node/group counts from initial subject tree. Missing hierarchy/incorrect parent paths or duplicate group membership can escape.",
    "Filter checks counters, not exact visibleTree/matchKindByNodeId. Reorder checks changed full permutation only, not exact desired order/structural semantics; planners do not apply mutations.",
    "Group rename planner checks target IDs not set payload; visibility only target IDs+opacity, not originalOpacity restoration. Runtime rename checks target leaf label and all OTHER element contents, not target preservation.",
